@startuml ssd-set-duration
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
mainframe sd Set Duration (E)

actor "사용자" as User
participant ":LifeGame" as System

User -> System : setFreezingDuration(n)
System -->> User : 지속 세대 n
note right : 1~999만 받는다 (처음 값 5).\n다음에 설치하는 영역에만 쓰인다
@enduml
